sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Platform as Platform Ingress<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant NemoGR as NeMo Guardrails Server<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant InputRails as Input Rails Pipeline
    participant OutputRails as Output Rails Pipeline
    participant Models as Baked-In ML Models<br/>(MiniLM, DeBERTa, etc.)
    participant LLM as LLM Inference Server<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over Client,LLM: Flow 1: Guarded Chat Completion
        Client->>Platform: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Headers: X-Authorization: Bearer <token>
        Platform->>NemoGR: Forward (TLS terminated)<br/>HTTP/8000
        NemoGR->>NemoGR: Header forwarding:<br/>X-Authorization → Authorization<br/>(inbound Authorization never forwarded)
        NemoGR->>InputRails: Evaluate input rails
        InputRails->>Models: Local ML inference<br/>(jailbreak, PII, content safety)
        Models-->>InputRails: Classification results
        InputRails-->>NemoGR: Input validation result

        alt Input rails PASS
            NemoGR->>LLM: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Auth: Bearer token (forwarded)<br/>HTTPS/TLS
            LLM-->>NemoGR: LLM response
            NemoGR->>OutputRails: Evaluate output rails
            OutputRails->>Models: Local ML inference<br/>(hallucination, fact-check)
            Models-->>OutputRails: Classification results
            OutputRails-->>NemoGR: Output validation result
            alt Output rails PASS
                NemoGR-->>Platform: Guarded response (JSON)
                Platform-->>Client: HTTPS response
            else Output rails FAIL
                NemoGR-->>Platform: Blocked/modified response
                Platform-->>Client: Guardrail intervention response
            end
        else Input rails FAIL
            NemoGR-->>Platform: Blocked response<br/>(input rejected)
            Platform-->>Client: Guardrail intervention response
        end
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over Client,NemoGR: Flow 2: Stateless Guardrail Check (/v1/checks)
        Client->>Platform: POST /v1/checks<br/>Body: messages + config_id
        Platform->>NemoGR: Forward (TLS terminated)<br/>HTTP/8000
        NemoGR->>NemoGR: Route by message role:<br/>user/system → input rails<br/>assistant → output rails
        NemoGR->>Models: Local ML inference
        Models-->>NemoGR: Classification results
        NemoGR-->>Platform: Check result (no LLM invoked)
        Platform-->>Client: Guardrail evaluation response
    end
